  [1mModule format note:[0m [38;5;153msrc/index.js[39m and [38;5;153msrc/utils.js[39m are CommonJS, so I [1mwon't[0m set [38;5;153m"type": "module"[39m in [38;5;153mpackage.json[39m. That
